# persian-typo-desktop
===
 Open-source (MIT), offline Persian typo fixer for Windows 10/11 and Linux. Corrects Arabic Yeh/Kaf, ZWNJ, spacing, digits & punctuation as you type in desktop apps. Lightweight tray app, custom rules, no account or telemetry. Browser extension also available.
